5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We need to stop guessing. I want to know what an even split actually costs. Who else wants to look into the paperwork?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Minako, the paperwork is a start, but I’m curious about the social friction. I’ll check what other households said about their breakdowns.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know why the car is never ready when I need it. I’ll check the state of the car at handover.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I’ll check last year’s fuel receipts and the hours recorded in the diary. We need real data, not assumptions.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I should look into the hours of use recorded in the diary. And maybe the mechanic's remarks? I just want to understand the time cost.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Shion, your data will help. I’ll check the tax and insurance papers to see the fixed baseline costs.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll also look into the spell of checking figures. We need to know what actually sours these groups before we repeat it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I’ll also check the trips that repeat weekly. Those are the ones that keep failing me.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I’ll also check the month’s trial of recording every run. We need to know the actual administrative burden before we commit to any system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll also look into the weeks of heavy use. I want to see how those bursts affect our evenings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’m confident in our choices. Let’s see what the data reveals before we argue about solutions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Let’s see what the data reveals before we argue about solutions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll wait for the facts. No point debating until we know what’s actually broken.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,Fine. Let the numbers speak. I’ll be here when you’re ready to face the reality.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I’ll just wait for the results. I hope the data helps us find a fair way forward.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let’s see what we find.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
