35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, but fuel is wildly unequal. Two people bought most of it. An even split ignores this reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The other households blamed the constant asking of favours. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The data confirms my suspicion. The car is often returned with the fuel light on and rubbish inside. Furthermore, three of us have fixed weekly trips that keep collapsing.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The receipts show two of us bought over half the fuel. One barely drove. And tracking it costs an hour weekly. We need a system that reflects actual usage, not just equal shares.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I found that Saturdays are used three times more than Tuesdays. And those heavy weeks really do eat up our evenings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"Shion, your data confirms mine. We cannot split 280,000 yen evenly when fuel usage is so skewed. We need a system that accounts for actual distance driven.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: Shion, your data confirms mine. We cannot split 280,000 yen evenly when fuel usage is so skewed. We need a system that accounts for actual distance driven.""}]}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,The checking phase was toxic. We must avoid a system that forces us to audit each other constantly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Benjamin: The checking phase was toxic. We must avoid a system that forces us to audit each other constantly.""}]}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, auditing is necessary if we want fairness. But I need a guarantee that the car is actually ready when I need it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, fairness requires data, not just feelings. But an hour weekly is a heavy price. We need a system that minimizes that administrative burden while still reflecting reality.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. The heavy weeks are the real problem. We need something that doesn't turn every trip into a negotiation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"We need a baseline. The 280,000 yen is fixed, but fuel varies. We must separate these costs to avoid subsidizing heavy users unfairly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: We need a baseline. The 280,000 yen is fixed, but fuel varies. We must separate these costs to avoid subsidizing heavy users unfairly.""}]}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The other households failed because every trip felt like a favour. We need a system where using the car is a right, not a request.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, separating costs is logical, but it doesn't fix the state of the car. I need a guarantee it's ready, not just a bill.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, separating costs is logical, but it doesn't fix the state of the car. I need a guarantee it's ready, not just a bill.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want the arranging to stop. If we can avoid those long evenings, I’m fine with whatever works.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"We need a system that respects the data. Fixed costs split evenly, fuel by distance. No more guessing.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: We need a system that respects the data. Fixed costs split evenly, fuel by distance. No more guessing.""}]}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. But if we make every trip a transaction, we risk becoming the households that failed. We need a right to use, not a favour.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, a booking system is useless if the car is returned with the fuel light on. I need a standard for handover, not just a calendar.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a standard is just a rule. I need the data to prove who is actually driving. Let’s see the options.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want the arranging to stop. If we can avoid those long evenings, I’m fine with whatever works.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
